	•	Section 1 Comments/Quotes: The study used the Standard Transplant Analysis and Research (STAR) data sources overseen by UNOS/OPTN and containing US transplantation records. The authors state that lung transplant recipient records from 1984 to 2021 were used, although the Methods also describe the STAR source as covering US transplants since 1987. The paper states that the authors received no financial support for the research and declared no potential conflicts of interest.

