	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Variables with more than 30% missing data were removed during expert preprocessing, but the handling of residual missing values was not described; this was therefore classified as Other rather than imputation. Class imbalance was explicitly addressed by oversampling and replicating minority-class observations. Data cleaning, consolidation, variable filtering, and transformation were described, and SAS Enterprise Miner was used. The paper states a 70:30 split but does not report exact integer training and test counts. Source code and trained model weights were not reported.

